# Durability disk store (Boundary 2b) — the relay mirrors irreplaceable
# PERSONAL FINANCIAL DATA here (ledger, journal, predictions, goals,
# portfolio). This must NEVER be committed. Constitution Article 7.
data/

# Backup exports the user may drop in the project root
jarvis-backup-*.json

# Secrets — none exist in this project today (the relay's write token is
# generated in-memory per-startup, never written to disk), but this guards
# against anything added later (e.g. if ORD-1511's AI seam is ever crossed
# and an API key needs a local config file).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secrets*

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
